OL,3,ACriminals detained in hospital set to
OL,4,Alose benefits
OL,5,
OL,6,FKillers and serious sex offenders
OL,7,Fdetained in hospital are among the
OL,8,Fcriminals who will no longer receive
OL,9,Fbenefits under proposals called for by
OL,10,Fvictims' families.
OL,12,FRegulations due to be laid in
OL,13,FParliament on Tuesday seek to end the
OL,14,F"double provision" and prevent serious
OL,15,Fcriminals receiving up to #800 a month
OL,16,Fin universal credit over several years
OL,17,Fwhile already having their bed and
OL,18,Fboard funded through the NHS while
OL,19,Freceiving psychiatric treatment.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
